OL,3,GNEWSAThe hunt for a new generation of
OL,4,Ablood donors
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents are being encouraged to find
OL,7,Fout their blood type and become donors
OL,8,Fas the NHS seeks a new generation of
OL,9,Fvolunteers to help maintain supplies.
OL,11,FNHS Blood and Transplant's community
OL,12,Fengagement team held a free "What's
OL,13,FYour Blood Type?" event at the
OL,14,FUniversity of Birmingham this week,
OL,15,Fwith people registering as donors and
OL,16,Fbooking appointments to give blood.
OL,18,FThe service needs about 5,000 blood
OL,19,Fdonations every day and a spokesperson
OL,20,Fsaid they were particularly keen to
OL,21,Fincrease stocks of O negative and B
OL,22,Fnegative blood.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
